        "text": [
          "Hello brave\nFencer!",
          "Right now it's\ntime to learn\nhow to duel.",
          "The objective is \nto score 5 or 15 \npoints before \nyour opponent.",
          "You gain a point \neach time ",
          "you \nsuccessfully land \na valid touch on \nthe opponent's body",
          "by performing an \nattack or \na counter-attack.",
          "Do you notice 3\nred bubbles in the\nleft corner?\nThis is stamina.",
          "Every block and\nattack costs\n1 point.",
          "It recovers really\nslowly. \nDo not waste all\npoints at once\nduring the duel.",
          "Time for some \npractise!\nHit target 3 times\nby pressing A \nbutton."
        ],
